{"name":"The Releasetok Bell","slug":"glyph-releasetok-bell","blurb":"On the voice street, Vesper carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Releasetok. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Releasetok Bell.","seal":"8786d4ac42a0c592e5c107a96d52fb2b8408e627dc92b8f37793a339d21eba70"}
